{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Ouch, My Back!", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "At the Bowling Alley", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 1, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 3, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "exercise regime", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a routine of physical activity to keep you fit and healthy ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I've started an exercise regime.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le03ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about free time activities.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "personal trainer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who helps you develop a proper  exercise regime ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I've been working out with a personal trainer for a couple of weeks.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le03ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to beat", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to win a game against someone in a competition", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: Let's see if I can beat you at this game.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le03ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "bowling", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the sport of throwing a large, heavy ball down a lane to knock over pins ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I haven't been bowling in years.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le03ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "relationship ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a personal connection to someone ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I've been talking a lot about our relationship.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le03ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to tone up", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to strengthen your muscles ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I can see you've toned up a little.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le03ob01aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Present Perfect Continuous vs Present Perfect", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Present Perfect tense to talk about a past action or an action that began in the past that is connected to the present in some way. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use Present Perfect Continuous tense to describe: <ul> \t<li> a single activity that lasts a long time, and </li> <li> an action that is repeated over a long period of time.</li></ul> These continue up to the present.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use the Present Perfect tense to talk about experience. <br/>When you use the Present Perfect tense, you think about the past and present together. There is some connection between what happened in the past and now. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example: <br/>  <span class=\"italic\"> I have learned English </span> = <span class=\"italic\"> I learned English in the past and now I can speak English.</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\"> He has bought a painting </span> =  <span class=\"italic\"> He bought the painting in the past and now he has a painting.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use the Present Perfect Continuous tense when a long activity has just stopped.<br/> <br/> To emphasize the action, use the continuous form.<ul><span class=\"italic\"> <li> We've been working really hard for a couple of months.</li></span> <span class=\"italic\"> <li> She's been having a hard time. </li></span></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "To emphasize the result of the action, use the simple form.<ul><span class=\"italic\"> <li> I've made fifteen phone calls this morning.</li></span><span class=\"italic\"> <li> He's written a very good report.</li></span></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"has/have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"been\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"verb +ing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"has\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"been\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"talking on the phone <span class=\\\"strong\\\">for</span> an hour.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"They\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"been\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"working there <span class=\\\"strong\\\">since</span> 2010.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": " <ul><li> You use FOR to talk about how long an action has been happening (a week, 2 days, five hours, six years etc.)</li> \t<li>You use SINCE to talk about when the action started (2010, Monday, she was a child)</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I've been training with a personal trainer for two weeks.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I haven't had any free time since I started there.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"content": "engenn7le03ob01re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Talking About Social Activities", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you talk about social activities, you often use the gerund form of a verb. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The gerund form is the noun form of a verb.<br/>  You form the gerund by adding <span class=\"strong\">ing</span> to the end of a verb. <br/> Gerunds are often used to talk about activities. <br/> <br/> Social activities are things you do with other people.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Gerund\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"garden\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"gardening\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I enjoy gardening on the weekends.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bowl\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bowling\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I have never been bowling.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"swim\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"swimming\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I've been swimming every day for ten years.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"watch\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"watching\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I like watching TV.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"cook\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"cooking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm taking cooking classes.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Interview a partner about their free time activities.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find about about what they do, how often they do it and how long they have been doing it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Prepare a written summary of the information.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Present the information to your class/partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I interview a partner about free time activities.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I prepare a written summary of the information.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about recent actions and routines.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use words like <span class=\"italic\">since</span>, <span class=\"italic\">for</span> to describe duration.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share the information with someone else.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le03ob01re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le03ob01re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hey, V. What have you been doing lately? I haven't seen you in ages.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hi, Sally. I've been so busy with the restaurant. I haven't had any free time since I started there. What have you been doing?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I've been spending a lot of time with my family. We've been eating out a lot and trying to catch up. I've also started an exercise regime ..."}, {"image": "engenn7le03ob01re2img01.jpg", "time": "23250", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, yeah? How long have you been doing that?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I've been training with a personal trainer for a couple of weeks.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Wow! A personal trainer! That's cool. I can see you've toned up a little.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, let's see if I can beat you at this game. I haven't been bowling in years."}, {"image": "engenn7le03ob01re2img05.jpg", "time": "41750", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Me neither! Marco and I have been talking a lot about our relationship.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Has anything been decided?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Not really ...<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: How long have you guys been dating?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: We've been trying to date for about six months. It feels like six years! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, have you been practicing your arm swing?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Not at all! This won't be much of a game, I'm afraid."}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le03ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le03ob01re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about social activities.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about recent actions and routines. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can use words like <span class=\"italic\">since</span>, <span class=\"italic\">for</span> to describe duration.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Have you ever been bowling? What did you think of it?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What have you been doing recently?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How long have you been studying English?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "fee